1
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:39,519
For such a high-profile investment fair,

2
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,959
our Special Police Unit assisting with security...

3
00:01:40,959 --> 00:01:41,719
is only to be expected.

4
00:01:43,239 --> 00:01:44,280
You don't have to comfort me.

5
00:01:44,439 --> 00:01:45,359
I'm used to it.

6
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:48,519
You shouldn't look at it that way.

7
00:01:49,079 --> 00:01:49,920
For an occasion this important,

8
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:51,040
the fact that the leaders thought of us

9
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:51,719
what does that show?

10
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:52,280
They value us.

11
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:53,799
Value us?

12
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:55,000
Maybe to you they value us.

13
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:55,799
But to me, this just means...

14
00:01:57,959 --> 00:01:58,680
Look, if it's really that bad,

15
00:01:59,040 --> 00:01:59,920
I'll lead the team today.

16
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,000
You stay behind and hold the fort.

17
00:02:01,519 --> 00:02:02,120
You lead the team?

18
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,120
Can you handle it?

19
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:05,680
What makes you think I can't?

20
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:06,799
Aren't you busy having the runs?

21
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:07,280
Busy...

22
00:02:11,159 --> 00:02:12,759
You've really got a smart mouth today.

23
00:02:16,919 --> 00:02:17,479
At ease!

24
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:18,719
Attention!

25
00:02:20,479 --> 00:02:21,120
Comrade Commander!

26
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,560
All personnel and equipment are present. Please advise!

27
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:24,800
Inspect equipment!

28
00:02:24,879 --> 00:02:25,240
Yes, sir!

29
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:27,319
Inspect equipment!

30
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,240
Baton!

31
00:02:29,199 --> 00:02:29,639
Flashlight!

32
00:02:30,599 --> 00:02:31,080
Handcuffs!

33
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:32,759
Body camera!

34
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,120
Knee pads!

35
00:02:34,199 --> 00:02:35,520
Aren't we just standing guard?

36
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,240
Elbow pads!

37
00:02:36,439 --> 00:02:37,400
What's the point of gearing up so much?

38
00:02:38,039 --> 00:02:38,520
Right?

39
00:02:45,199 --> 00:02:45,680
Lü Xiao!

40
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:46,800
Here, sir!

41
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,080
What did you just say?

42
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,840
Sir, I didn't say anything!

43
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:51,759
Bai Jiani!

44
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:52,240
Here, sir!

45
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,520
What did he just say?

46
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:54,919
He just told Shorty

47
00:02:55,719 --> 00:02:56,439
that we're just standing guard.

48
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:57,840
Is it necessary to be fully geared up?

49
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:01,680
Fair point.

50
00:03:03,879 --> 00:03:04,599
What else do you want to say?

51
00:03:07,719 --> 00:03:08,719
I also feel humiliated.

52
00:03:09,879 --> 00:03:10,919
We train like our lives depend on it every day,

53
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:13,439
but our missions are either acting or being background props.

54
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:16,120
People even made up a jingle for us.

55
00:03:18,599 --> 00:03:19,479
A jingle? Let's hear it.

56
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:23,759
For arrests, there's the Criminal Investigation Unit.

57
00:03:24,719 --> 00:03:26,520
For asset recovery, there's the Economic Crime Division.

58
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:29,360
For brains, there's the Narcotics Unit.

59
00:03:32,479 --> 00:03:33,400
And the Special Police are just an honor guard every day.

60
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:39,919
Very well said.

61
00:03:42,599 --> 00:03:43,879
We're in no rush today.

62
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:46,840
If anyone has any thoughts,

63
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:49,800
if you're feeling stifled or wronged...

64
00:03:50,639 --> 00:03:51,400
just let it all out.

65
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:02,560
Wang Yunsheng.

66
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:02,960
Here.

67
00:04:04,719 --> 00:04:05,120
I don't.

68
00:04:06,719 --> 00:04:07,840
Are you sure about that?

69
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:08,439
Sir.

70
00:04:09,439 --> 00:04:09,919
I'm sure.

71
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:16,560
Everyone feels wronged.

72
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,439
Stifled.

73
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,319
I feel even more stifled.

74
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,399
They look down on us.

75
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:26,759
Does that mean we shouldn't

76
00:04:26,759 --> 00:04:27,879
take ourselves seriously?

77
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:36,480
What is the Special Police Unit?

78
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:37,160
Sir.

79
00:04:37,439 --> 00:04:38,480
It's the sword that strikes down evil,

80
00:04:38,879 --> 00:04:39,959
the shield that guards the people,

81
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:41,439
and this city's

82
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:42,879
last line of defense.

83
00:04:46,879 --> 00:04:47,600
The way I do things,

84
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,439
I don't beat around the bush.

85
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,560
And I don't like it when others do.

86
00:04:55,199 --> 00:04:56,480
I won't stand in anyone's way.

87
00:04:58,879 --> 00:04:59,800
Everyone has their own ambitions.

88
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:03,879
If you truly feel wronged here,

89
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:06,879
stifled, or humiliated,

90
00:05:08,199 --> 00:05:08,759
submit a request.

91
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:10,439
I'll approve it.

92
00:05:17,079 --> 00:05:17,439
Lü Xiao.

93
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,319
Sir.

94
00:05:19,839 --> 00:05:22,360
I've never thought about leaving the Special Police Unit.

95
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:23,519
Commander Liao,

96
00:05:24,279 --> 00:05:25,519
Commander Liao must lead the team.

97
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,639
Don't worry, Director Tan.

98
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,000
We're getting ready to head out now.

99
00:05:30,199 --> 00:05:30,560
Good, good.

100
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:33,120
This Director Tan sure pushes hard.

101
00:05:34,319 --> 00:05:36,040
Old Liao, I can't go with you.

102
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,120
Gurong Station just called.

103
00:05:38,319 --> 00:05:40,480
Said there's a crowd gambling on Da'an Road.

104
00:05:40,519 --> 00:05:41,319
They asked us for backup

105
00:05:42,959 --> 00:05:43,800
to bust the gamblers.

106
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:45,920
They need the Special Police Unit?

107
00:05:47,439 --> 00:05:48,879
The station's officers are all out on patrol.

108
00:05:48,879 --> 00:05:49,560
They're short-handed.

109
00:05:52,279 --> 00:05:53,000
That works out well.

110
00:05:53,879 --> 00:05:54,680
Otherwise, if you come with us

111
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:56,079
and stand around for hours,

112
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,800
your stomach won't be able to take it.

113
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:58,839
I'll leave a squad with you.

114
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,759
No need, it's just a gambling bust.

115
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,079
It'll be done in no time.

116
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:03,720
Lü Xiao.

117
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:04,439
Here.

118
00:06:04,959 --> 00:06:05,240
Step forward.

119
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:05,879
Yes, sir.

120
00:06:08,879 --> 00:06:10,000
What was with your attitude just now?

121
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,160
What Commander Liao said,

122
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:14,000
I heard loud and clear from the restroom.

123
00:06:15,399 --> 00:06:16,319
Leave this kid with me.

124
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,720
I'll set him straight on the way.

125
00:06:23,439 --> 00:06:24,160
Attention, everyone!

126
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,600
About-face!

127
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:28,519
Board the vehicles!

128
00:06:33,199 --> 00:06:34,199
Let me remind you of something.

129
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:34,879
What is it?

130
00:06:36,959 --> 00:06:38,000
Bring enough toilet paper.

131
00:06:38,399 --> 00:06:39,759
Alright, stop nagging.

132
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,160
So annoying.

133
00:06:46,639 --> 00:06:47,639
What kind of driving is that?

134
00:06:47,639 --> 00:06:48,759
Officer, he hit my car!

135
00:06:48,759 --> 00:06:49,680
Couldn't you see someone was in front of me?

136
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:50,720
Was I supposed to run them over?

137
00:06:50,839 --> 00:06:52,079
Someone in front, but there's a car behind you!

138
00:06:52,079 --> 00:06:52,639
Can't you see?

139
00:06:52,639 --> 00:06:53,560
You didn't keep a safe distance yourself!

140
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,439
And you're blaming me?

141
00:06:56,079 --> 00:06:56,519
Are you blind?

142
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,120
Can't you see there's a car in front of me?

143
00:07:02,759 --> 00:07:03,519
Hey, no fighting.

144
00:07:03,639 --> 00:07:04,480
Don't get physical.

145
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,720
If you fight, it's a whole different story.

146
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,959
Look what he did to my car!

147
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:08,000
He's entirely at fault!

148
00:07:08,199 --> 00:07:08,920
Stop yelling, stop yelling.

149
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:10,839
It's just a little scrape.

150
00:07:10,839 --> 00:07:11,839
It's no big deal.

151
00:07:12,639 --> 00:07:13,800
Move your cars out of the way first, okay?

152
00:07:13,839 --> 00:07:14,360
Don't block the road.

153
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,759
Look at the traffic jam you've caused back there.

154
00:07:15,759 --> 00:07:16,439
Here's what you two do.

155
00:07:16,439 --> 00:07:17,720
Come on, move your cars over there.

156
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:18,839
Park them over there.

157
00:07:19,839 --> 00:07:21,240
Talk it out nicely. Just talk it out.

158
00:07:21,399 --> 00:07:22,480
Go, go, go.

159
00:07:26,199 --> 00:07:26,839
What's going on?

160
00:07:27,879 --> 00:07:28,560
Go on!

161
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,519
Hurry up and move!

162
00:07:31,639 --> 00:07:32,560
Sorry about that, Comrade Officer.

163
00:07:32,759 --> 00:07:34,040
I just got my license, sorry.

164
00:07:34,079 --> 00:07:34,600
Just passed my test.

165
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:38,560
Are you done?

166
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:39,839
Alright, alright, alright.

167
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:42,879
Go, go, go. Hurry up.

168
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:45,439
Old Liu!

169
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:49,040
You've put on weight.

170
00:07:49,399 --> 00:07:50,079
What a coincidence!

171
00:07:50,399 --> 00:07:51,160
Have I?

172
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:53,160
Looks like the traffic cops eat well!

173
00:07:54,279 --> 00:07:54,720
It's not bad.

174
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:56,399
What mission are you on?

175
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,040
We're in different branches, so I can't tell you.

176
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,560
Don't forget.

177
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:01,839
I'm just on a temporary transfer, okay?

178
00:08:02,519 --> 00:08:03,040
Temporary transfer?

179
00:08:03,399 --> 00:08:05,560
I've never seen anyone on a temporary transfer come back.

180
00:08:06,439 --> 00:08:07,160
Saying something like that...

181
00:08:07,279 --> 00:08:08,519
That really hurts, let me tell you.

182
00:08:08,639 --> 00:08:09,519
Go, go, go.

183
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:10,519
We're off, Brother Lang.

184
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,120
All right, all right.

185
00:08:11,319 --> 00:08:11,879
See you, Captain Liu.

186
00:08:11,879 --> 00:08:12,680
Okay, okay. Bye, bye.

187
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,079
Bye.

188
00:08:15,079 --> 00:08:15,639
Captain Liu.

189
00:08:15,879 --> 00:08:16,480
Captain Liu, over here.

190
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:17,600
Captain Liu.

191
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:20,240
I've always, always wanted to ask you something.

192
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,439
What is it, kid?

193
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:24,199
Which smells better, 92 or 95 octane gas?

194
00:08:26,199 --> 00:08:27,800
Bai Jiani, you're hopeless.

195
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,759
You've picked up their bad habits too.

196
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:30,000
Hurry up and go. Just go.

197
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:30,519
Captain Liu.

198
00:08:30,519 --> 00:08:31,319
What? You have something to say too?

199
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,320
Your hat's crooked.

200
00:08:32,679 --> 00:08:33,240
It's fine.

201
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,080
You guys talk too much, I'm telling you.

202
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:35,759
Hurry up and go.

203
00:08:38,399 --> 00:08:40,240
A big captain like you doing patrol duty yourself?

204
00:08:40,279 --> 00:08:41,200
Of course.

205
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,360
Out here in the wind and sun.

206
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:24,039
Okay, that's good.

207
00:09:25,799 --> 00:09:26,559
Switch to a wide-angle.

208
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,039
Point it at this intersection.

209
00:09:28,399 --> 00:09:30,679
Later, when the Special Police Unit arrives,

210
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,799
make sure to get a shot of their entrance.

211
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:33,600
You got it.

212
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:51,000
This restroom

213
00:09:51,519 --> 00:09:52,679
is incredibly filthy.

214
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,120
Political Commissar,

215
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:56,879
I told you not to drink that overnight tea.

216
00:09:57,919 --> 00:09:58,720
Let me get you some medicine.

217
00:09:58,879 --> 00:09:59,679
Don't change the subject.

218
00:10:00,919 --> 00:10:02,120
Reflect on your own issues.

219
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,279
Listen here, kid.

220
00:10:07,279 --> 00:10:08,440
Is it your first day at the Special Police Unit?

221
00:10:09,919 --> 00:10:10,480
The

222
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:12,759
importance of having all your gear ready,

223
00:10:13,759 --> 00:10:14,840
does the Commander still need to spell it out?

224
00:10:16,159 --> 00:10:17,320
He told you, and you were still defiant.

225
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:17,960
Right?

226
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:20,879
What?

227
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,759
Is the Special Police Unit too small for you now?

228
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:23,440
Is it?

229
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:26,159
No.

230
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:32,559
How many times have I stressed this?

231
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,200
As Special Police,

232
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:35,480
every time we deploy,

233
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,279
we might end up crossing paths

234
00:10:37,639 --> 00:10:38,440
with criminals.

235
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:39,440
We must be...

236
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:41,200
We must always be ready to make the ultimate sacrifice.

237
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,360
Every piece of our gear is

238
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:44,279
a weapon to protect people's lives and property,

239
00:10:44,399 --> 00:10:45,879
and a tool for our self-defense.

240
00:10:45,879 --> 00:10:46,960
Always be prepared.

241
00:10:47,159 --> 00:10:49,000
Shed our blood on the battlefield,

242
00:10:49,159 --> 00:10:50,399
and never regret joining the police force.

243
00:10:51,679 --> 00:10:52,480
Full marks, Political Commissar?

244
00:10:55,519 --> 00:10:56,799
Don't push too hard, you've got an upset stomach.

245
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:00,919
You knowingly broke the rules.

246
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:04,600
Don't just treat it as a slogan.

247
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:05,759
Take it to heart.

248
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,559
Go write a self-criticism.

249
00:11:11,799 --> 00:11:12,559
Make it a deep one.

250
00:11:12,759 --> 00:11:13,480
I still have to write a self-criticism?

251
00:11:13,799 --> 00:11:14,120
Write it.

252
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:17,679
Political Commissar, they've started gambling over here.

253
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:18,679
Copy that.

254
00:11:34,399 --> 00:11:35,120
The cops are here!

255
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:37,279
Don't move!

256
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:37,879
Nobody move!

257
00:11:37,879 --> 00:11:38,399
Everybody get down!

258
00:11:38,399 --> 00:11:39,440
All of you, get down!

259
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:40,080
Hands on your heads!

260
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:42,519
Get down! Hands on your heads! Get down!

261
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:44,039
Hand over your phones!

262
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:45,080
Your phones! Hand them over!

263
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:48,720
What are you running for?

264
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:49,360
Don't try anything.

265
00:11:49,679 --> 00:11:50,559
Got something to hide?

266
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:51,799
No, no.

267
00:11:51,879 --> 00:11:53,600
Alright, relax. Just stay down properly. Stay down.

268
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:55,360
Lü Xiao.

269
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:56,840
Go check the back room.

270
00:11:57,639 --> 00:11:58,000
On it.

271
00:11:59,639 --> 00:12:01,080
Everyone, just cooperate.

272
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:02,519
Don't make things hard on yourselves.

273
00:12:03,879 --> 00:12:05,480
Hands on your heads! Stay down!

274
00:12:25,159 --> 00:12:25,720
Nobody here.

275
00:12:29,799 --> 00:12:30,600
Comrade Officer,

276
00:12:30,639 --> 00:12:31,840
we're just here for fun.

277
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:32,440
Get over here.

278
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:33,320
Whether you're just having fun,

279
00:12:33,399 --> 00:12:34,360
we'll find out.

280
00:12:34,399 --> 00:12:35,360
Just cooperate.

281
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:37,120
Hurry up!

282
00:12:37,759 --> 00:12:38,399
Move!

283
00:12:42,559 --> 00:12:43,000
Keep up.

284
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:45,639
Stay close.

285
00:12:48,759 --> 00:12:49,519
Move faster!

286
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:51,000
Keep up in the back!

287
00:13:09,799 --> 00:13:10,399
Lü Xiao

288
00:13:12,919 --> 00:13:14,240
Hurry and take them away.

289
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:15,279
I need to head back.

290
00:13:15,279 --> 00:13:15,879
I'll wait for you in the car.

291
00:14:14,559 --> 00:14:15,279
What are you doing here?

292
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:17,200
Me?

293
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:19,679
I'm from next door.

294
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:21,279
Next door?

295
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:25,039
There was a lot of noise over here just now.

296
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:27,120
I just came to see what was going on.

297
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:30,399
Come here.

298
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:32,200
Let me see your ID.

299
00:14:34,919 --> 00:14:35,440
My ID?

300
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:37,919
I don't have it on me.

301
00:14:38,399 --> 00:14:39,399
I'll go back and get it.

302
00:14:39,399 --> 00:14:39,840
No need.

303
00:14:40,279 --> 00:14:41,360
Let me see your phone instead.

304
00:14:43,600 --> 00:14:44,200
My phone?

305
00:14:56,639 --> 00:14:57,120
What is this?

306
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:00,600
I asked you, what is this?

307
00:15:04,799 --> 00:15:05,240
Don't move.

308
00:15:07,919 --> 00:15:08,279
Step back.

309
00:15:10,559 --> 00:15:11,240
I said, step back.

310
00:15:40,159 --> 00:15:41,519
Commander Liao! Commander Liao!

311
00:15:42,759 --> 00:15:43,279
Looking sharp!

312
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:46,639
Commander Liao.

313
00:15:47,559 --> 00:15:49,840
Once the guest steps onto the red carpet,

314
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:50,720
we'll salute.

315
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:54,080
Will you give the order, or...

316
00:15:54,679 --> 00:15:56,000
No need. They know what to do.

317
00:15:56,799 --> 00:15:58,000
The key is to be in sync.

318
00:15:58,159 --> 00:15:58,919
How about a practice run?

319
00:15:58,919 --> 00:15:59,600
No need.

320
00:16:02,799 --> 00:16:03,039
Here they come.

321
00:16:03,919 --> 00:16:06,240
I trust you'll all be perfectly in sync.

322
00:16:21,279 --> 00:16:21,879
Salute!

323
00:16:43,639 --> 00:16:45,080
Attention all, mount up!

324
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:50,759
Commander Liao, why did you pull everyone out?

325
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,960
This is the municipal government's very own

326
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:55,480
foreign investment conference!

327
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:57,159
How can you just drop everything?

328
00:16:59,080 --> 00:17:01,000
This was approved by Chief Guo!

329
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:03,200
Right in front of the city officials and foreign guests,

330
00:17:03,320 --> 00:17:04,000
you pull everyone out.

331
00:17:04,279 --> 00:17:05,319
You should know the consequences!

332
00:17:06,359 --> 00:17:08,000
Received higher orders to relocate and reinforce.

333
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:09,680
Liao Bufan!

334
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:32,559
That unit

335
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:34,119
The guy must've escaped from here.

336
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:43,599
Must've vaulted over this railing,

337
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:44,880
then from this platform,

338
00:18:45,559 --> 00:18:46,000
jumped down.

339
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:14,119
How many times have I told you?

340
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:16,440
I just went to pay the electric bill and was coming right back.

341
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:19,039
I told you to wait at home and not run off.

342
00:19:19,599 --> 00:19:21,079
Why won't you listen?

343
00:19:22,559 --> 00:19:23,240
You scared me to death!

344
00:19:23,240 --> 00:19:24,920
When it happened, this kid was right at the door.

345
00:19:31,440 --> 00:19:32,200
Is this your son?

346
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:38,359
Hey there, buddy.

347
00:19:41,240 --> 00:19:41,720
Don't be scared.

348
00:19:42,599 --> 00:19:44,079
Tell me, what's your name?

349
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:45,599
How old are you?

350
00:19:50,240 --> 00:19:51,680
His name is Naonao. He's five.

351
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:55,680
Naonao.

352
00:19:57,160 --> 00:19:58,319
Tell me,

353
00:19:59,200 --> 00:20:01,160
did you see anything when it happened?

354
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:19,000
There was someone in the window.

355
00:20:22,880 --> 00:20:24,759
Did you get a good look at him?

356
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:29,960
Think carefully.

357
00:20:30,720 --> 00:20:32,240
I'm sorry, Comrade Officer.

358
00:20:32,519 --> 00:20:34,200
He's had a weak heart since childhood.

359
00:20:34,200 --> 00:20:35,480
I'm afraid he was frightened.

360
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:37,799
We have a hospital appointment for a checkup.

361
00:20:38,079 --> 00:20:38,960
At 11:30.

362
00:20:39,799 --> 00:20:40,759
We're running a bit late.

363
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:43,680
Please leave your phone number.

364
00:20:44,839 --> 00:20:45,880
I'll contact you if anything comes up.

365
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:46,440
Okay.

366
00:20:51,400 --> 00:20:52,160
Okay, thank you.

367
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:56,000
We'll be going now.

368
00:20:59,279 --> 00:21:00,799
Don't run off on your own again, understand?

369
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:02,000
Got it?

370
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:12,000
You're here.

371
00:21:13,920 --> 00:21:14,400
What's the situation?

372
00:21:16,079 --> 00:21:16,680
We're looking into it.

373
00:21:20,519 --> 00:21:21,279
There's no need to go in.

374
00:21:22,839 --> 00:21:23,440
Where's Political Commissar Lu?

375
00:21:26,119 --> 00:21:26,960
Where is Political Commissar Lu?

376
00:21:32,519 --> 00:21:33,599
The medical examiner took him away.

377
00:21:46,839 --> 00:21:47,440
Chief Guo...

378
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:50,160
Liao Bufan was completely out of line today.

379
00:21:50,319 --> 00:21:52,119
Walking off right in front of the leaders.

380
00:21:52,440 --> 00:21:53,319
I couldn't even stop him.

381
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:54,599
Look at what he did.

382
00:21:55,039 --> 00:21:56,799
The leaders looked extremely displeased.

383
00:21:57,400 --> 00:21:57,920
You said before

384
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:58,599
that some officers

385
00:21:58,599 --> 00:22:00,319
can't even follow an elementary schooler's code of conduct.

386
00:22:00,519 --> 00:22:01,160
Now I believe it.

387
00:22:01,519 --> 00:22:02,319
And then there's Lu Zhong.

388
00:22:02,519 --> 00:22:03,160
He's not answering his phone

389
00:22:03,279 --> 00:22:03,839
or replying on WeChat.

390
00:22:03,839 --> 00:22:04,440
Enough.

391
00:22:05,279 --> 00:22:06,440
Comrade Lu Zhong died in the line of duty.

392
00:24:03,920 --> 00:24:04,680
Old Lu

393
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:07,440
Lu Zhong

394
00:24:13,839 --> 00:24:14,400
Old Lu

395
00:24:18,279 --> 00:24:18,960
Old Lu

396
00:24:44,279 --> 00:24:44,759
Lü Xiao

397
00:24:50,200 --> 00:24:51,279
Where is Lü Xiao?

398
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:24,319
Come here.

399
00:25:44,079 --> 00:25:45,279
What the hell are you good for?

400
00:25:49,559 --> 00:25:51,480
What the hell are all of you good for?

401
00:26:04,039 --> 00:26:04,839
What's going on?

402
00:26:15,880 --> 00:26:17,119
After we finished checking the private room,

403
00:26:19,480 --> 00:26:20,319
we thought it was empty.

404
00:26:23,039 --> 00:26:24,640
Political Commissar Lu sent me back to the station.

405
00:26:26,319 --> 00:26:27,319
He went to the restroom.

406
00:26:35,319 --> 00:26:35,839
And then...

407
00:26:37,359 --> 00:26:38,480
then we left.

408
00:26:39,400 --> 00:26:40,440
I walked to the car,

409
00:26:40,799 --> 00:26:41,839
and heard a gunshot.

410
00:26:43,240 --> 00:26:45,640
That guy must have been right behind that window.

411
00:26:46,599 --> 00:26:47,480
I didn't check.

412
00:26:48,720 --> 00:26:49,839
If I had just checked,

413
00:26:49,839 --> 00:26:50,839
Political Commissar Lu wouldn't have died.

414
00:27:04,880 --> 00:27:06,079
If I weren't in traffic,

415
00:27:07,119 --> 00:27:08,240
this job today

416
00:27:11,039 --> 00:27:12,000
would've been mine.

417
00:27:37,880 --> 00:27:38,559
Attention, everyone!

418
00:28:02,759 --> 00:28:03,880
Wipe your tears.

419
00:28:19,720 --> 00:28:20,759
Old Lu is gone.

420
00:28:34,440 --> 00:28:35,200
We're still here.

421
00:28:40,400 --> 00:28:40,880
Commander Liao,

422
00:28:42,720 --> 00:28:44,359
Commissar Lu's phone has been ringing for a while.

423
00:28:44,920 --> 00:28:46,960
Maybe you should answer it.

424
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:29,519
Ma'am.

425
00:29:35,359 --> 00:29:36,119
We're together.

426
00:30:22,640 --> 00:30:23,200
Liao Bufan!

427
00:30:25,559 --> 00:30:26,279
Let go!

428
00:30:26,400 --> 00:30:27,000
Let go!

429
00:30:27,400 --> 00:30:28,000
Let go!

430
00:30:30,039 --> 00:30:30,799
What's wrong with you?

431
00:30:34,720 --> 00:30:35,279
Let go!

432
00:30:36,680 --> 00:30:37,440
Let go!

433
00:30:38,319 --> 00:30:38,920
Calm down!

434
00:30:46,079 --> 00:30:46,880
Are you out of your mind?

435
00:31:28,240 --> 00:31:28,839
Political Commissar!

436
00:31:30,799 --> 00:31:32,039
Political Commissar! Political Commissar!

437
00:31:33,200 --> 00:31:33,799
Political Commissar!

438
00:31:35,640 --> 00:31:36,200
Political Commissar!

439
00:31:41,039 --> 00:31:42,359
Before Lu Zhong entered the restroom,

440
00:31:43,200 --> 00:31:44,799
he turned off his body camera,

441
00:31:44,799 --> 00:31:46,119
so a segment of the video is missing.

442
00:31:50,200 --> 00:31:51,519
When Lu Zhong and his team were busting the gambling ring,

443
00:31:51,799 --> 00:31:53,599
they searched the scene.

444
00:31:54,240 --> 00:31:57,160
This means the killer wasn't discovered at that time.

445
00:31:57,640 --> 00:31:59,400
Based on the traces at the scene, we can infer

446
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:01,000
that during the raid,

447
00:32:01,319 --> 00:32:03,240
the killer must have climbed out of

448
00:32:03,240 --> 00:32:04,400
the window in the innermost room

449
00:32:04,559 --> 00:32:05,960
and jumped onto the platform outside.

450
00:32:06,440 --> 00:32:07,880
After Lu Zhong and his team left,

451
00:32:08,359 --> 00:32:09,799
the killer thought it was safe again,

452
00:32:09,799 --> 00:32:11,519
so he returned to the crime scene,

453
00:32:12,119 --> 00:32:14,480
and ran right into Lu Zhong coming out of the restroom.

454
00:32:15,799 --> 00:32:17,799
Lu Zhong must have interrogated the killer.

455
00:32:19,240 --> 00:32:20,200
That bag of powder on the ground

456
00:32:20,599 --> 00:32:21,319
is highly suspicious.

457
00:32:22,039 --> 00:32:23,799
So Lu Zhong turned on his

458
00:32:23,799 --> 00:32:24,720
body camera again.

459
00:32:25,799 --> 00:32:26,799
The moment he took the powder,

460
00:32:27,920 --> 00:32:28,920
the killer opened fire.

461
00:32:32,440 --> 00:32:32,960
Comrades,

462
00:32:35,519 --> 00:32:36,160
it's been many years

463
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:37,119
since Hongye City

464
00:32:38,359 --> 00:32:40,640
has seen such a vicious crime.

465
00:32:44,799 --> 00:32:46,119
Tell us your specific thoughts.

466
00:32:50,440 --> 00:32:52,799
Based on the fingerprints on this balcony railing

467
00:32:53,200 --> 00:32:54,480
and the footprints on the platform,

468
00:32:54,640 --> 00:32:55,319
we can infer that

469
00:32:55,480 --> 00:32:56,640
at the scene of Lu Zhong's death,

470
00:32:56,759 --> 00:32:58,559
there were at least three suspects.

471
00:32:59,200 --> 00:32:59,920
After the incident,

472
00:33:00,279 --> 00:33:01,799
they jumped off the balcony

473
00:33:01,799 --> 00:33:03,039
and escaped through the back alley.

474
00:33:04,279 --> 00:33:06,720
Right now, the three sets of prints are being run through the database.

475
00:33:08,839 --> 00:33:10,559
Have you checked the surveillance footage at the scene?

476
00:33:12,440 --> 00:33:13,880
It's an old residential area with no cameras.

477
00:33:16,279 --> 00:33:17,920
Our men are doing a door-to-door search.

478
00:33:22,359 --> 00:33:24,000
The two pellets found at the scene

479
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:25,680
are homemade 12-gauge shotgun shells.

480
00:33:27,079 --> 00:33:28,039
We've already deployed personnel

481
00:33:28,039 --> 00:33:29,400
at the train stations and ports

482
00:33:29,519 --> 00:33:30,599
to conduct targeted inspections,

483
00:33:30,960 --> 00:33:32,200
looking for any suspicious individuals.

484
00:33:36,039 --> 00:33:37,640
As for the scattered

485
00:33:38,160 --> 00:33:38,599
powder in Lu Zhong's hand,

486
00:33:38,880 --> 00:33:39,960
we suspect it's drugs.

487
00:33:40,519 --> 00:33:42,160
The Narcotics Unit is testing it right now.

488
00:33:42,160 --> 00:33:43,039
We don't have the results yet.

489
00:33:45,799 --> 00:33:46,119
Alright.

490
00:33:47,640 --> 00:33:48,359
Everyone, take a seat for now.

491
00:33:55,799 --> 00:33:56,599
Have you found the killer?

492
00:34:00,640 --> 00:34:01,599
We're in the middle of a meeting!

493
00:34:07,279 --> 00:34:07,680
Chief Guo.

494
00:34:09,599 --> 00:34:10,400
Political Commissar Lu died in the line of duty.

495
00:34:12,199 --> 00:34:14,440
Our Special Police Unit needs answers.

496
00:34:14,440 --> 00:34:15,480
Needs answers?

497
00:34:16,760 --> 00:34:17,639
What answers do you need?

498
00:34:21,119 --> 00:34:21,840
Who do you think you represent?

499
00:34:22,119 --> 00:34:22,760
Reporting to Chief Guo,

500
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:25,519
I represent the Hongye Police Department's Special Police Unit.

501
00:34:25,519 --> 00:34:26,239
Liao Bufan!

502
00:34:28,840 --> 00:34:30,039
Comrade Lu Zhong died in the line of duty.

503
00:34:31,119 --> 00:34:33,480
He wasn't just the Political Commissar of your Special Police Unit.

504
00:34:33,920 --> 00:34:35,719
He was also a member of our Hongye Police Force.

505
00:34:37,079 --> 00:34:38,599
He was a comrade-in-arms to all of us.

506
00:34:40,599 --> 00:34:41,280
If anyone needs an answer,

507
00:34:42,840 --> 00:34:43,760
it's all of us who

508
00:34:43,760 --> 00:34:44,840
owe Political Commissar Lu an answer.

509
00:34:49,760 --> 00:34:50,920
What is the purpose of the police?

510
00:34:52,199 --> 00:34:53,360
It is to protect the good people

511
00:34:53,679 --> 00:34:54,360
and deter the bad ones.

512
00:34:55,280 --> 00:34:56,280
At a time when public security

513
00:34:56,960 --> 00:34:58,679
continues to improve,

514
00:34:59,880 --> 00:35:01,639
someone actually dared to take a gun

515
00:35:02,119 --> 00:35:03,320
and shoot our officer dead.

516
00:35:04,599 --> 00:35:06,679
Where will the public's sense of security come from then?

517
00:35:06,679 --> 00:35:07,400
Tell me!

518
00:35:10,159 --> 00:35:10,920
Starting today,

519
00:35:12,039 --> 00:35:13,480
all leaves in the department are canceled.

520
00:35:14,480 --> 00:35:15,280
Mobilize our forces

521
00:35:15,920 --> 00:35:17,360
across the entire city and its counties

522
00:35:18,000 --> 00:35:19,119
for a comprehensive, zero-blind-spot search.

523
00:35:22,239 --> 00:35:22,719
Chief Guo,

524
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:25,920
the lab results for that bag of powder are out.

525
00:35:27,400 --> 00:35:28,599
The composition matches "Spring Snow".

526
00:35:30,320 --> 00:35:31,159
"Spring Snow" again.

527
00:35:38,760 --> 00:35:39,400
I announce

528
00:35:40,440 --> 00:35:41,880
the formation of the 215 Special Task Force.

529
00:35:42,599 --> 00:35:44,280
The Narcotics Unit and Criminal Investigation Unit will work together.

530
00:35:44,719 --> 00:35:46,960
Make sure we pin this killer down right here in Hongye!

531
00:35:47,320 --> 00:35:47,960
Yes, sir!

532
00:36:05,559 --> 00:36:06,400
Reporting, Chief Guo.

533
00:36:07,000 --> 00:36:07,960
The Special Police Unit

534
00:36:08,039 --> 00:36:09,000
has assembled.

535
00:36:09,440 --> 00:36:10,360
Awaiting orders.

536
00:36:25,880 --> 00:36:26,280
Stand at ease.

537
00:36:28,239 --> 00:36:28,760
Comrades,

538
00:36:30,440 --> 00:36:32,039
I completely understand how you feel.

539
00:36:33,840 --> 00:36:34,880
Political Commissar Lu's sacrifice

540
00:36:35,920 --> 00:36:37,360
is a knife plunged

541
00:36:37,360 --> 00:36:37,920
into all of our hearts.

542
00:36:39,280 --> 00:36:39,599
It hurts.

543
00:36:41,400 --> 00:36:43,440
Only by bringing the killer to justice quickly

544
00:36:44,280 --> 00:36:46,039
can we truly honor Political Commissar Lu.

545
00:36:48,000 --> 00:36:48,559
You

546
00:36:49,559 --> 00:36:50,599
must always remember

547
00:36:51,519 --> 00:36:53,440
that you represent a collective.

548
00:36:56,119 --> 00:36:58,360
We must not be consumed by personal emotions.

549
00:36:59,800 --> 00:37:00,559
We must stay calm.

550
00:37:01,519 --> 00:37:02,119
We must exercise restraint.

551
00:37:03,199 --> 00:37:03,800
I demand

552
00:37:05,559 --> 00:37:06,639
that from this moment on,

553
00:37:07,559 --> 00:37:08,280
the Special Police Unit

554
00:37:09,039 --> 00:37:10,760
must follow combat response protocols

555
00:37:11,440 --> 00:37:13,639
and conduct 24-hour patrols.

556
00:37:15,119 --> 00:37:16,280
We must let the people know

557
00:37:17,159 --> 00:37:18,239
that in this city,

558
00:37:19,119 --> 00:37:20,199
as long as the People's Police are here,

559
00:37:21,119 --> 00:37:22,159
they are safe

560
00:37:22,719 --> 00:37:23,679
and secure.

561
00:37:33,039 --> 00:37:34,599
The Special Police Unit guarantees

562
00:37:35,719 --> 00:37:37,239
that whenever there's a lead,

563
00:37:38,320 --> 00:37:39,559
within five minutes,

564
00:37:39,559 --> 00:37:40,280
our backup will be in position.

565
00:37:41,920 --> 00:37:44,599
Please give the Special Police Unit a chance!

566
00:37:45,360 --> 00:37:48,079
Please give the Special Police Unit a chance!

567
00:37:54,800 --> 00:37:55,360
Salute!

568
00:38:50,039 --> 00:38:50,840
Who are you?

569
00:38:57,480 --> 00:38:59,679
I saved those dumplings for my son.

570
00:38:59,679 --> 00:39:00,400
I'm your son.

571
00:39:00,880 --> 00:39:01,239
You...

572
00:39:15,840 --> 00:39:16,679
It really is Gangzi.

573
00:39:18,199 --> 00:39:20,719
Gangzi, where have you been these past two days?

574
00:39:24,440 --> 00:39:25,840
You... help me take a look.

575
00:39:26,119 --> 00:39:26,800
These pills of mine...

576
00:39:27,400 --> 00:39:28,360
How should I take them?

577
00:39:28,719 --> 00:39:29,920
Two red ones, one white one.

578
00:39:30,400 --> 00:39:32,639
Two red ones, one white one.

579
00:39:35,360 --> 00:39:36,599
Why is there so much blood on you?

580
00:39:37,079 --> 00:39:38,199
Did you get into a fight again?

581
00:39:38,840 --> 00:39:39,880
Are you hurt?

582
00:39:39,880 --> 00:39:40,400
Stop asking.

583
00:39:40,880 --> 00:39:41,599
You... you... you...

584
00:39:41,800 --> 00:39:43,239
Are you hurt anywhere?

585
00:39:44,880 --> 00:39:46,719
If you're hurt, you need to go to the hospital.

586
00:39:48,280 --> 00:39:48,840
What are you doing?

587
00:39:49,360 --> 00:39:50,480
Are you leaving again?

588
00:39:50,480 --> 00:39:51,719
Stop asking, will you?

589
00:39:53,000 --> 00:39:53,159
You...

590
00:39:54,400 --> 00:39:54,920
You're...

591
00:39:55,599 --> 00:39:56,079
You're...

592
00:39:57,920 --> 00:39:58,400
Son...

593
00:39:58,880 --> 00:39:59,280
Dad.

594
00:40:00,400 --> 00:40:01,000
Remember.

595
00:40:01,800 --> 00:40:03,440
Two red ones, one white one.

596
00:40:04,039 --> 00:40:04,599
Repeat it.

597
00:40:05,559 --> 00:40:07,760
Two red ones, one white one.

598
00:40:09,239 --> 00:40:09,800
I'm leaving.

599
00:40:20,559 --> 00:40:21,280
Where's my gun?

600
00:40:27,199 --> 00:40:30,039
Two red ones.

601
00:40:31,559 --> 00:40:33,519
One white one.

602
00:40:35,920 --> 00:40:36,360
Right?

603
00:40:49,800 --> 00:40:52,800
The dumplings are cold. Want me to heat them up?

604
00:40:55,840 --> 00:40:56,320
No need.

605
00:40:59,440 --> 00:41:00,960
Come, sit here.

606
00:41:04,840 --> 00:41:06,000
No need. I'll just stand.

607
00:41:08,119 --> 00:41:09,079
Don't be nervous.

608
00:41:28,719 --> 00:41:30,920
So you're Gangzi's classmates.

609
00:41:34,400 --> 00:41:36,239
What grade are you in, then?

610
00:41:48,320 --> 00:41:48,960
I'll eat this.

611
00:41:49,880 --> 00:41:51,159
That address you mentioned...

612
00:41:51,719 --> 00:41:52,639
We went there.

613
00:41:54,440 --> 00:41:55,400
No one was there.

614
00:42:01,679 --> 00:42:02,880
She definitely lives there.

615
00:42:06,320 --> 00:42:07,679
Then you go bring her here.

616
00:42:17,199 --> 00:42:18,559
Right now, that whole area

617
00:42:18,960 --> 00:42:20,480
is swarming with cops.

618
00:42:21,599 --> 00:42:22,000
I...

619
00:42:22,960 --> 00:42:23,440
I...

620
00:42:30,079 --> 00:42:31,639
You find her

621
00:42:32,039 --> 00:42:32,920
and hand her over to us.

622
00:42:34,679 --> 00:42:37,480
Or your dad is a dead man.

623
00:42:39,039 --> 00:42:39,960
Are we clear?

624
00:42:56,880 --> 00:42:58,880
Want me to make some more?

625
00:42:59,559 --> 00:43:00,039
It's delicious.

626
00:43:11,880 --> 00:43:13,079
This whole incident is

627
00:43:13,079 --> 00:43:15,840
the result of incomplete intelligence gathering.

628
00:43:16,239 --> 00:43:17,119
We underestimated them.

629
00:43:17,519 --> 00:43:18,400
From now on,

630
00:43:18,559 --> 00:43:21,079
your Economic Crime Division officially joins the task force.

631
00:43:21,360 --> 00:43:23,360
I found it behind that tree.

632
00:43:23,679 --> 00:43:25,320
We pulled a few fingerprints from it,

633
00:43:25,760 --> 00:43:27,400
which matched the suspect, Jin Yonggang.

634
00:43:27,639 --> 00:43:28,480
The Special Police Unit is in position.

635
00:43:28,920 --> 00:43:29,920
Ready to breach at any time.

636
00:43:32,119 --> 00:43:32,800
Mr. Jin,

637
00:43:33,119 --> 00:43:34,039
it's Xiaomin.
